WEBVTT

00:01:28.736 --> 00:01:31.899
Kwa mfano, Sarah, ana miaka 10.

00:01:32.418 --> 00:01:34.799
Amebakwa mara kadhaa na baba yake wa kambo

00:01:34.823 --> 00:01:37.545
na kutishiwa ukatili
kama akimwambia mtu.

00:01:38.259 --> 00:01:41.544
Faisal, alipigwa katika viganja vya mikono
shuleni kwa waya,

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:42.919
kadhalilishwa na kuitwa punda

00:01:42.943 --> 00:01:46.585
akasimamishwa nje kwenye baridi
kwa kukosea kujibu swali.

00:01:47.998 --> 00:01:51.776
Na kwa washirika tunaofanya nao kazi
kufanya mitandao uwe salama kwa watoto

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:54.522
tunasikia hadithi kama za Angelika.

00:01:54.546 --> 00:01:56.522
Miaka kumi na mbili,

00:01:56.546 --> 00:02:00.498
akilazimishwa kufanya ngono 
na mjomba wake,